course: dictionary
lesson: 3352
title: What is an example?
level: primary-4
stars: 1
explain: An example is one case that shows how something works or what something is like. «A dog is an example of a mammal» means a dog is one clear case that shows you what a mammal is.
explain: Example can also mean a person or act that others can copy. When someone «sets a good example», they behave in a way that others want to follow.
explain: Writers often use «for example» to add a case that makes their meaning clear. «For example, a girl in London kicks her ball over the fence» gives one real case to show what the writer means.
fact: An example is one case that shows how something works or what something is like.
fact: «For example» (e.g.) comes before a case that explains what you mean.
fact: An example can also be a person or act that others can copy: set a good example.
fact: In maths, a worked example shows each step: «3 bags with 4 apples in each bag; 3 × 4 = 12 apples».
fact: Example is a noun, and its plural is examples.
exercise: «A dog is an example of a mammal.» What does example mean here? | A dog that has lost its way | A long word | A kind of food | *One case that shows what a mammal is like
exercise: Ruby always shares her toys, so the younger children copy her. She sets a good example. What does «sets a good example» mean? | Buys a new bike | Breaks the rules | Hides from everyone | *Behaves in a way others can copy
exercise: In «For example, a girl in London kicks her ball over the fence», which words introduce the case? | kicks her ball | over the fence | a girl in London | *For example
test: «Example: 3 bags with 4 apples in each bag; 3 × 4 = 12 apples». What is the total number of apples? | *12 | 43 | 1 | 7
test: «Socrates tested definitions with examples that broke them.» What were the examples used to do? | Make the definition longer | *Check whether the definition really works | Cook a meal | Find a new word
exam: Ben says, «Set a good example for your little sister.» What does Ben mean? | Tell her a story about a dog | Give her a spelling test | *Show her how to behave so she can copy you | Buy her a present
